  "description": "Single storey front extension incorporation porch, Single storey rear extension, Creation of basement, 2 storey side extension with gable end wall to form a loft conversion with rear dormer and front roof windows.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed two storey side extension with alterations to roof to form rear dormer,\r\nassociated roof alterations&amp;nbsp;and increased roof ridge height, by reason of\r\ntheir inappropriate form and design, would result in an obtrusive and\r\nconspicuous addition. The development would form an unsympathetic extension to\r\nthe building, disrupting the symmetry of the semi-detached pair and appearing\r\nat odds with the character of the host dwelling and the prevailing streetscape.\r\nConsequently, the proposal would cause harm to the character and appearance of\r\nthe area, contrary to the high-quality design aspirations of the National\r\nPlanning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 (D.1 and D.11) of the London Plan\r\n(2021), Policy DM1 of the Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013),\r\npolicy CS1 B of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012)&amp;nbsp;and the relevant provisions\r\nof the adopted Harrow Residential Design Guide Supplementary Planning Document\r\n(2010).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
